# 1. INTRODUCTION

Welcome to Eldho's Textures.

Eldho's Textures is a Minecraft resource pack compilation created and maintained by REAL_ELDHO.

This project combines carefully selected visual enhancements, PvP improvements, user interface modifications, quality-of-life features and other Minecraft resource pack elements into one convenient package.

This license establishes the terms and conditions under which individuals may download, access, use and privately modify Eldho's Textures.

By downloading, accessing, installing or using this resource pack, you acknowledge that you have read, understood and agreed to the applicable terms of this license.

If you do not agree with these terms, you must not use the materials covered by this license.

---

# 2. PERMITTED USES

Subject to this license and the licences governing any third-party components, users are permitted to:

### 2.1 Personal Downloading

Download Eldho's Textures from its official distribution sources for personal use.

### 2.2 Personal Installation

Install and use the resource pack in Minecraft for personal gameplay.

### 2.3 Private Modification

Modify, customize, edit or replace textures and other components for personal use.

### 2.4 Private Customization

Create personal variations of the resource pack, including:

* Changing item textures.
* Modifying block appearances.
* Customizing GUI elements.
* Changing particle effects.
* Adjusting visual elements.
* Adding or removing compatible resource pack components.

### 2.5 Personal Backups

Create private backup copies of the resource pack for personal archival purposes.

All permitted modifications must respect the rights and licensing conditions of the original creators whose materials are included.

