# 3. RESTRICTIONS

The following activities are strictly prohibited for materials owned by REAL_ELDHO unless explicit written permission has been obtained.

### 3.1 No Public Redistribution

You may not redistribute, share, transfer or distribute the original resource pack or modified versions publicly.

This includes:

* Uploading modified versions to GitHub.
* Publishing modified versions on Modrinth.
* Publishing modified versions on CurseForge.
* Uploading modified versions to Planet Minecraft.
* Sharing modified versions through public download websites.
* Distributing modified versions through public Discord servers.
* Uploading modified versions to file-sharing platforms.
* Publishing modified versions through personal websites.

### 3.2 No Reuploading

You may not reupload the original Eldho's Textures package to another platform or distribute it as your own resource pack.

### 3.3 No Unauthorized Republishing

You may not publish, release, sell or otherwise make modified versions of materials owned by REAL_ELDHO publicly available.

Private modifications are permitted under Section 2.

### 3.4 No Ownership Misrepresentation

You may not:

* Claim that Eldho's Textures was created by you.
* Remove or falsify original authorship information.
* Present REAL_ELDHO's original work as your own.
* Misrepresent your involvement in creating this project.

### 3.5 No Unauthorized Commercial Distribution

You may not sell, commercially distribute or monetize the original resource pack or modified versions of materials owned by REAL_ELDHO without explicit written permission.

### 3.6 No Unauthorized Branding

You may not use the REAL_ELDHO name, branding or project identity to imply that your own projects are officially created, approved or maintained by REAL_ELDHO.

